(Jae Seok, don't you do kissing here?)

1940
01:08:06,285 --> 01:08:07,755
(Have you not kissed lately?)

1941
01:08:07,755 --> 01:08:08,825
(Flustered)

1942
01:08:08,825 --> 01:08:09,825
(My dad actually...)

1943
01:08:09,825 --> 01:08:11,855
(caught an octopus while peeing once.)

1944
01:08:11,855 --> 01:08:13,625
(It came out because my pee was hot.)

1945
01:08:13,625 --> 01:08:15,625
(It's that hot?)

1946
01:08:15,665 --> 01:08:17,465
(Isn't yours hot?)

1947
01:08:17,465 --> 01:08:19,465
(A conversation that pushes the boundaries)

1948
01:08:19,465 --> 01:08:21,305
(And upgraded anger)

1949
01:08:21,305 --> 01:08:24,135
(Jae Seok and So Min's chemistry is coming.)

1950
01:08:24,275 --> 01:08:26,735
(Yunho's deduction who is full of passion)

1951
01:08:26,735 --> 01:08:28,445
(- What? - This place is real.)

1952
01:08:28,445 --> 01:08:30,445
