(Why?)

1955
01:08:32,575 --> 01:08:35,085
(Wasn't the owner pretty warm?)

1956
01:08:35,245 --> 01:08:36,845
(I felt his sense of desperation.)

1957
01:08:36,945 --> 01:08:38,415
(I can feel the warmth.)

1958
01:08:38,415 --> 01:08:40,955
(Is he a softie as much as he's passionate?)

1959
01:08:40,955 --> 01:08:43,055
(You look like you're easy to scam.)

1960
01:08:43,055 --> 01:08:44,955
(He's actually very innocent.)

1961
01:08:44,955 --> 01:08:47,595
(Please look forward to Yunho's adjustment.)

1962
01:08:47,595 --> 01:08:49,465
(Don't let your guard off until the end.)

1963
01:08:49,565 --> 01:08:51,095
(The one who shocked everyone...)

1964
01:08:51,095 --> 01:08:52,835
(and made everyone freeze)

1965
01:08:52,835 --> 01:08:54,765
(The last fake item is coming.)

1966
01:08:54,935 --> 01:08:58,135
(The final match of "Sixth Sense: B-Side" is coming soon.)
